ch-shadow title, rotating neon spinner ring, 12 orbiting particle dots, smooth fade-ins/outs.\nMain Menu – Glass-morphism frame with dual neon strokes, UIGradient, smooth inertia dragging + momentum glide.\nToggles – 6 premium checkboxes with hover scale + color pulse, checkmark animation, divider, and instant on/off.\nGun Indicator – Live “⚔️ Gun Detected” badge with neon styling.\nAim Mode Selector – Clickable box cycling through 5 modes (including “Both”).\nTooltip – Follows mouse with feature descriptions.\nWatermark – Pulsing “NB” with breathing transparency + stroke animation (top-right corner).\nSmart Positioning – Auto-centers and clamps to screen edges on resize/respawn.\nNotifications + Sounds – Roblox built-in notifications + satisfying toggle SFX.\n\nControls & Cleanup\n\nInsert – Toggle entire UI visibility.\nEnd – Full graceful shutdown (restores values, disconnects everything, destroys GUI, no memory leaks).\nAnti-Detection – Randomized GUI name, jitter delays, pcall safety everywhere, original value backups.\n\nRecommended Executor: https://xeno.onl/download","tags":["Speedhack","ShootFast","Recoil Control","Perfect Aim","Nekoblox"],"script":"https://limewire.com/d/wjLTm#Du4gJGzGqg\n\nInsert key fixed and end key fixed so now you can hide/show UI and kill it aswell as it's features and functions completely from game I recommend doing this before leaving the server and changing or exiting game.\n\nRecommended Free Executor: https://xeno.onl/download","owner":{"_id":"69b9ff6807a74a82f85de759","username":"DrNeusence","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/69b9ff6807a74a82f85de759-1774664542437.jpg","status":"offline","id":"69b9ff6807a74a82f85de759","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":10}},"verified":false,"discord":"https://discord.gg/xqc8AuUPy6","views":5086,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/-1-1775627648527.png","likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-04-07T